<title>USA: Telecom Argentina group gets $100 mln in financing.</title>
<headline>Telecom Argentina group gets $100 mln in financing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment Securities said it lead managed a $100 million five-year financing deal for Telecom Argentina STET - France Telecom SA.</p>
<p>Santander said Telecom Argentina will use the proceeds of the financing for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The loan is Telecom Argentina's first international syndicated bank loan, Santander said.</p>
<p>The loan's co-agents were ANZ Bank and Deutsche Bank, Santander added.</p>
</text>
